Category: Changed

The previous implementation prioritized custom environment variables for gateway routing and authentication, leading to confusion and duplicated configuration. This change removes support for reading legacy gateway variables from the environment, instead directing users to set provider-specific variables like OPENAI_API_KEY and OPENAI_BASE_URL. Breaking behavior: CHANGELOG_LITELLM_API_BASE and CHANGELOG_LITELLM_API_KEY are no longer read from the environment.
